SUMMARY:Brookwood Casserole Delivery Day Grand Parkway - Aug. 14
DESCRIPTION:What’s for Dinner? We’ve Got You!\nBrookwood Casserole Delivery Days are here for your August chaos.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days – Grand Parkway Pickup!\nPre-order now and pick up Friday\, August 14 | 5:00–6:30pm📍 Gallery Furniture – 7227 W Grand Pkwy S\, Richmond\, TX 77407 \n\nCitizens at The Brookwood Community™ know August can feel like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher meet-and-greets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—with Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casseroles to choose from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your way home✅ Serve 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults with disabilities who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Casserole Lineup:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms\, basil\, and penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chicken EnchiladaRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, Latin-style red sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 King Ranch Chicken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort classic made with tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas\, and creamy cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order Discounts:\n\nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% with code: 10CASS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for helping change the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n🗓️ Want to know where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n 
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-grand-parkway-aug-14/
