SUMMARY:Fall Container Workshop Lunch and Learn Aug 28
DESCRIPTION:Autumn Blooms & Lunch at Brookwood\n  \nFall Container Garden Workshop with Brookwood’s Horticulture Manager\, Robert Grove\nJoin Brookwood Horticulture Manager Robert Grove for a hands-on Fall Container Garden Workshop that celebrates the beauty of the season. You’ll design and plant your own stunning autumn-inspired container garden using plants lovingly grown by Brookwood Citizens right here on campus. \nWhether you’re a seasoned gardener or just ready to try something new\, Robert will share expert tips\, creative inspiration\, and easy techniques to help your fall arrangement thrive all season long. Best of all\, you’ll head home with a beautiful custom container garden you created yourself! \nBefore the workshop begins\, enjoy a fresh and delicious meal at The Brookwood Café\, where every bite supports the mission of The Brookwood Community and empowers adults with disabilities to live lives of purpose and meaning. \n\nTwo sessions to choose from on Friday\, August 28 \n\n10:30 AM\nNoon\n\nBrookwood Café\n1502 FM 1489\nBrookshire. TX 77423 \nGrab your tickets here!\n  \n\nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/fall-container-workshop-lunch-and-learn-aug-28/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX\, 77423\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured on home page
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/202606-Aug-Lunch-Learn-Website-Event-Image.png
