SUMMARY:Brookwood's Annual Fall Fest - Sept. 10-12
DESCRIPTION:Embrace the Beauty of Fall at Brookwood!\n\nThursday–Saturday | September 10-12 | 9:00am–4:30pm\nBrookwood® Gift & Garden Center and Café | 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX 77423 \nCelebrate the beauty of fall and the power of purpose at Brookwood® Fall Fest! Shop an incredible variety of artisan vendor booths featuring handcrafted gifts\, seasonal décor\, and one-of-a-kind treasures—perfect for early holiday prep or just treating yourself! \nSupport local makers and adults with disabilities at The Brookwood Community™ all in one festive fall day! Stroll through the Brookwood Gift & Garden Center stocked with Citizen-made ceramics\, garden goods\, home accents\, and stunning fall florals. \n🎁 Shop with a Purpose. Dine with a Purpose. Celebrate Fall with a Purpose with over 40 Local Vendors!\n🍽️ Savor a delicious lunch at The Brookwood Café from 11:00am–2:30pm\n☕ Stop by our Coffee Cart for delicious drinks\, tasty snacks\, and convenient box lunches\n🌿 Sip and shop at the Wine Bar in the Garden \nMake it a day to remember—and a weekend that gives back!\n\nAre you a Vendor? Contact the Gift Shop at 281-375-2149 to get details!\n  \nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwoods-annual-fall-fest-sept-10-12/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX\, 77423\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured on home page
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/THE-BROOKWOOD-GIFT-GARDEN-CENTER-1502-FM-1489-BROOKSHIRE-TX-77494-WWW.BROOKWOODCOMMUNITY.ORG-1-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
