SUMMARY:Bulbs for the Gulf Coast Lunch and Learn Sept. 25
DESCRIPTION:Planting for Beautiful Seasonal Color\nJoin us for the Bulbs for the Gulf Coast Lunch & Learn at The Brookwood Café! Discover how to select\, plant\, and care for beautiful bulbs that thrive in Gulf Coast landscapes and bring lasting color to your garden throughout the seasons. \nEnjoy a delicious lunch while our gardening experts share practical tips\, seasonal planting advice\, and creative inspiration to help your bulbs flourish in Texas gardens. Plus\, each guest will receive a special take-home gift to continue the experience at home. \nGather your friends and join us for an afternoon of great food\, gardening inspiration\, and blooming possibilities! \nJoin us Friday\, September 25\, 2026 at 10:30 AM \nBrookwood Café\n1502 FM 1489\nBrookshire. TX 77423 \nRegister Here! \n\n$45.00 (plus tax) includes a delicious lunch at the Brookwood Café.\nParticipants will receive a special\, take-home gift!\nPLEASE NOTE:  If you would like to sit with specific people\, please be sure to leave a note with their names in the Notes section when you check out.\n\n  \n  \nCANCELLATION POLICY: \n\nFull Refund (100%): Requests made 7 or more days before the event date will be eligible for a full refund.\nPartial Refund (50%): Requests made between 6 days and 48 hours before the event date will be eligible for a 50% refund.\nNo Refund: Requests made less than 48 hours before the event or on the same day as the event will not be eligible for a refund.\n\n\n  \n\nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/bulbs-for-the-gulf-coast-lunch-and-learn-sept-25/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX\, 77423\, United States
