SUMMARY:Succulent Pumpkin Workshop Oct 9-10
DESCRIPTION:Brookwood Horticulture Workshop: Succulent Pumpkin Centerpiece\nA Fall Favorite You Won’t Want to Miss!\n\n\nAutumn is calling—and so are the pumpkins! Join us for one of Brookwood’s most beloved seasonal traditions: the Succulent Pumpkin Centerpiece Workshop\, led by Horticulture GM Robert Grove. In this hands-on experience\, you’ll blend the rich textures of fall with the fresh beauty of succulents to craft a one-of-a-kind centerpiece that’s perfect for your table—or to gift to someone special! \n🍂 What’s Included: \n\nCreate & Take: Design your very own succulent pumpkin masterpiece to take home and enjoy all season long.\nExpert Guidance: Learn arrangement tips and care techniques from Brookwood’s own horticulture pro\, Robert Grove.\nFlexible Scheduling: Choose from 10 sessions over two days—making it easy to fit into your busy fall calendar.\n\nCelebrate the beauty of the season with friends\, creativity\, and purpose—surrounded by the plants grown and cared for by the incredible Citizens of Brookwood®. \n\n📍 Hosted at Brookwood Gift & Garden Center🌟 Let your fall décor tell a story of creativity\, community\, and heart. \n\n\nDates: Friday & Saturday\, October 9 & 10\, 2024 \nTime: Choose from Five Sessions Each Day: \n\n\n9-10 AM\n10:15-11:15 AM\n11:30 AM-12:30 PM\n1-2 PM\n2:30-3:30 PM\n\nLocation: Horticulture Building\, Behind the Garden Center \n\nRegistration: $45 (plus tax) covers all the materials needed to make your own centerpiece. Space is limited\, so reserve your spot today! \nGrab your tickets today!\n\n\n  \nDining Options: \n\n\nLunch at The Brookwood Café: Available Friday and Saturday from 11 AM – 2 PM.\nLunch reservations are required and can be made here: https://bit.ly/BWOpenTable\nPlease note: Food is not included with the event ticket.\n\n  \nJoin us for an inspiring afternoon of horticultural know-how\, flavorful food\, and a purposeful take-home gift! Reserve your spot today! \nWhen you’re in the checkout cart\, please click the “ORDER NOTE” option to let us know if you’d like to sit with specific guests. Be sure to include their names so we can arrange seating accordingly. Please note that our luncheon tables seat up to 8 guests. \n\n\n  \nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood! \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nCANCELLATION POLICY: \n\nFull Refund (100%): Requests made 7 or more days before the event date will be eligible for a full refund.\nPartial Refund (50%): Requests made between 6 days and 48 hours before the event date will be eligible for a 50% refund.\nNo Refund: Requests made less than 48 hours before the event or on the same day as the event will not be eligible for a refund.
