SUMMARY:2026 Brookwood Community Car Show Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Rev Up Your Engines for a Cause!\nJoin us on Saturday\, Nov. 1 from 8:00am to 2:00pm for a Car Show Fundraiser like no other\, benefiting The Brookwood Community! Over 100 jaw-dropping classic cars will be on display\, competing for exciting prizes and awards\, including the prestigious Gordon L. Bisel Best Corvette Award\, Citizen Favorites Award\, and the coveted Best of Show Trophy! \nCalling all car enthusiasts! It’s just $30 to pre-register your vehicle (or $40 on the day of the event) to get in on the action. 1st\, 2nd\, & 3rd Place Awards for each class. Your vehicle is registered when the Registration Form is complete and Payment received. Use the links below! \nRegistration opens in September\nVehicle classes include: \n\nGordon L. Bisel Best Corvette Award\nCitizen Favorites Awards\nBest of Show Trophy\n\nFor spectators\, admission is free!\nEnjoy a delicious breakfast or lunch at The Brookwood Café (lunch reservations suggested via Open Table). Plus\, don’t miss the chance to grab some goodies at the Brookwood Gift & Garden Center—perfect for some early holiday shopping! \n  \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n  \n 
